* PVCELL commutation (double-pulse) test - Infineon IMYH200R024M1H_cal x1, 1200 V, 40.0 A, L_loop 15.0 nH, R_G 6.385388802266175 ohm per device. Generated by sim/pv_tradeoff.py
.model dut VDMOS(Vto=4.5 Kp=5 lambda=0.01 Rd=0.008185 Rs=0.5m Rg=6.0 Cgs=4.839e-09 Cgdmax=9.7e-10 Cgdmin=1.1e-11 a=0.2447 Cjo=3.004e-09 Vj=3 M=0.5 Is=7.58e-16 N=3 Rb=0.01285 Tt=0)
Vdc dcp 0 1200.0
Rloop dcp dl 5m
Lloop dl dtop 1.5e-08
Rdamp dl dtop 10.0
Iload dtop mid 40
